From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mosip-vivid <vivid@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:28:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] liveness: operator onboarding face capture gated on
 OPERATOR liveness

- OperatorBiometricCaptureScanBlockView._scanBlock: for the Face
  attribute, run an OPERATOR liveness session (stricter policy) before
  invokeDiscoverSbi("operatorBiometrics", ...).
- BiometricsDetailsApi.parseRCaptureResponse (operator branch): the
  onboarding face is stored only if it matches that session's anchor
  (LivenessCaptureBinder with Workflow.OPERATOR); it becomes the
  reference for login face matching.
- UserOnboardService.onboardOperator: nothing in release-1.2.x writes
  the "user_id" preference, so templates were saved under usr_id ""
  and each onboarding deleted the previous operator's rows. Fall back to
  preferred_username (the IDA individual id and user_detail id).
---
