 .../liveness/LivenessCaptureBinder.java       |  9 +++++-
 .../service/UserOnboardService.java           | 11 ++++++--
 ...tor_biometric_capture_scan_block_view.dart | 28 ++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

